# Canonical identity for this repository.
#
# Maps the author/committer identities that belong to the repository owner so
# `git log`, `git shortlog` and GitHub all render them as a single person.
#
#   ktc@protonmail.ch  has appeared as both "bh90210" and "Byron"
#
# The simple form below canonicalises both the name and the email for every
# commit made with that address, so no per-commit entries are needed.

bh90210 <ktc@protonmail.ch>
